      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64823,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 371,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 459,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "ICD-11 coding",
    "headingPosition": 3,
    "headingid": 372,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64824,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 372,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>GA14.0 Polyp of vagina</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 460,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Related terminology",
    "headingPosition": 4,
    "headingid": 373,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64825,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 373,
        "headingText": "<p><em>Acceptable:</em> M&uuml;llerian papilloma of infancy</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-26T14:47:16"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 461,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Subtype(s)",
    "headingPosition": 5,
    "headingid": 374,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64826,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 374,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 462,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 375,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64827,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 375,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>M&uuml;llerian papillomas may be mucosal-based or intramural, with a variable location in the vagina {26948653}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64828,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Most cases occur in prepubertal girls, with a few cases reported in adolescents or young adults (age range: 2&ndash;24&nbsp;years) {26948653; 25330952; 21073126; 11737317; 9891250}. Most patients present with vaginal bleeding {26948653}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64829,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These are extremely rare vaginal neoplasms.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64830,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64831,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The pathogenesis is uncertain, but this neoplasm is believed to arise from M&uuml;llerian epithelium {9891250; 6170416}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64832,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Mucosal-based papillomas are friable polypoid lesions {26948653; 25330952; 19616458}, whereas intramural examples are solid-cystic mural masses {9891250; 6170416}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64833,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Histology shows an exophytic or intramural lesion with a papillary architecture and slender fibrovascular cores lined by cuboidal or columnar epithelium with little or no cytological atypia {9891250; 11737317; 19616458}. Nuclei are uniform, with fine chromatin. Mitoses are generally absent or sparse. Squamous metaplasia may be present.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64834,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 382,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64835,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 382,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64836,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> papillary architecture; cuboidal or columnar epithelium with no cytological atypia.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64837,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64838,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The clinical outcome is favourable {26948653; 19616458}, but recurrence, including multiple recurrences, has been reported {30406704; 7979569; 10193336}. Malignant transformation to clear cell carcinoma after multiple recurrences was reported in one case {12713630}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:04:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]